{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1cada2da",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Patent Citation Counts \u2014 C3 / C5 / C10 / C_all (+ examiner / applicant / other)\n",
    "\n",
    "Forward-citation counts received by each US **utility** patent within four windows (**3, 5, 10, full**),\n",
    "and \u2014 since patent citations carry a source tag \u2014 each window is also split into\n",
    "**examiner / applicant / other**. Primary key: `patent_id`.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Raw data (directory & structure)\n",
    "```\n",
    "E:/Dawoon Jeong/Data/PatentView/Granted/\n",
    "\u251c\u2500\u2500 g_patent.tsv.zip              # patent_id, patent_type, patent_date              -> grant year, utility filter\n",
    "\u2514\u2500\u2500 g_us_patent_citation.tsv.zip  # patent_id(citing), citation_patent_id(cited), citation_category\n",
    "```\n",
    "Utility\u2194utility citations only.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Metric (formula)\n",
    "For focal patent $P$ and window $W$: $C_W(P)=\\#\\{c \\text{ cites } P: 0 \\le y_c - y_P \\le W\\}$\n",
    "($C_{\\mathrm{all}}$ = all with $y_c \\ge y_P$). Category split by `citation_category`:\n",
    "`c_examiner` = `cited by examiner`; `c_applicant` = `cited by applicant`; `c_other` = everything else\n",
    "(`cited by other`, third party, imported, missing). Within a window, `C{w} = C_examiner{w}+C_applicant{w}+C_other{w}`.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Output\n",
    "`notebook/patent/output/patent_citation.parquet` \u2014 `patent_id` + `C{w}` and\n",
    "`C_examiner{w}, C_applicant{w}, C_other{w}` for `w \u2208 {3,5,10,all}`.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Citation-category provenance & caveats (examiner / applicant / other)\n",
    "`citation_category` (formerly `uspatentcitation.category`) is keyed to the **grant (issue) date**, and its\n",
    "coding scheme changed over time:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **\u2264 2000 grant years:** no citation-source distinction exists \u2014 `citation_category` is **NULL/blank**, so\n",
    "  everything falls into `c_other`.\n",
    "- **2001-01 \u2192 2012 grant years:** for patents *printed on/after 2001-01-01*, the USPTO started marking\n",
    "  references the examiner listed on form **PTO-892** with a star (*), so **only examiner citations became\n",
    "  identifiable**. Sources other than the examiner (applicant IDS submissions, protests, attorney\n",
    "  submissions, \u2026) were **not** distinguished, so the data holds only **`cited by examiner`** vs\n",
    "  **`cited by other`** \u2014 i.e. applicant citations are lumped into `other` in this window.\n",
    "- **\u2265 2013-01 grant years:** with the granted-patent full-text XML **v4.4**, an explicit three-way coding\n",
    "  begins \u2014 **`cited by applicant` / `cited by examiner` / `cited by third party`**. (PatentsView forum: before\n",
    "  patent **8,353,062** (granted 2013), `cited by applicant` never appears; every citation is coded examiner\n",
    "  or `cited by other`.)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Two things to keep in mind when analyzing:**\n",
    "1. Because the basis is the **grant date (not the filing date)**, the category distribution changes\n",
    "   **discontinuously around 2013**, and `c_applicant` is \u22480 before 2013 **by construction** (a labeling\n",
    "   change, not a behavior change).\n",
    "2. In **2001\u20132012**, `cited by other` is in practice mostly **applicant (IDS)** citations, so many studies\n",
    "   use it as an applicant proxy (protest / third-party are a tiny tail). See\n",
    "   `Patent_Analysis/10_Examiner_Applicant_Fixed.ipynb` for the corrected merge that treats pre-2013\n",
    "   `cited by other` as applicant.\n",
    "3. Further caveat: references an applicant submitted via IDS that the examiner *initialed* but did **not**\n",
    "   re-list on PTO-892 are **not** starred even if used in a rejection \u2014 so `cited by examiner` is closer to\n",
    "   citations the **examiner independently added**.\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Provenance:** citations split into **examiner** (`cited by examiner`), **non-examiner** (`applicant` + other), and **unknown** (`NULL`, pre-2001 grants with no origin info \u2014 kept separate, not merged into applicant). **`cited by third party` is excluded** from all counts. `C_{w}` = `C_examiner_{w}` + `C_non_examiner_{w}` + `C_unknown_{w}`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "69ffa42c",
